$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~9 min | Difficulty: Easy]] Nightjar is a black ops cell: no roster, no insignia, assault Vipers that officially do not exist. Day one. A Cylon supply anchorage sits three kilometres from the rocks the cell is hiding in: three Movers and a pair of Raider guards. Hit it fast, hit it hard, and be gone before anyone calls it in.", -1)
$end_multi_text

